 "clips": [
  {
   "id": "hook",
   "who": "melody",
   "text": "Have you ever looked at music and wondered what all those lines and dots actually mean? Let's find out!"
  },
  {
   "id": "today",
   "who": "barnaby",
   "text": "Today we are going to learn some musical names."
  },
  {
   "id": "five",
   "who": "melody",
   "text": "Music is written on five lines like this."
  },
  {
   "id": "count",
   "who": "melody",
   "text": "Count them with me!"
  },
  {
   "id": "n1",
   "who": "melody",
   "text": "One."
  },
  {
   "id": "n2",
   "who": "melody",
   "text": "Two."
  },
  {
   "id": "n3",
   "who": "melody",
   "text": "Three."
  },
  {
   "id": "n4",
   "who": "melody",
   "text": "Four."
  },
  {
   "id": "n5",
   "who": "melody",
   "text": "Five."
  },
  {
   "id": "stave",
   "who": "melody",
   "text": "Five lines together are called a stave."
  },
  {
   "id": "clef1",
   "who": "melody",
   "text": "This swirly symbol next to me is called a clef. It tells us how high or low to play."
  },
  {
   "id": "clef2",
   "who": "melody",
   "text": "This one is called the treble clef, and it is used for higher sounds!"
  },
  {
   "id": "bass",
   "who": "barnaby",
   "text": "And this clef looks totally different. Two dots and a curl. That's the bass clef, for lower sounds!"
  },
  {
   "id": "note",
   "who": "melody",
   "text": "This little blob with a stick is called a note. It sits on the stave to show us which sound to play."
  },
  {
   "id": "line",
   "who": "melody",
   "text": "A note can sit on a line, like this one,"
  },
  {
   "id": "space",
   "who": "melody",
   "text": "or in the gap between two lines, which we call a space."
  },
  {
   "id": "high",
   "who": "barnaby",
   "text": "Sometimes a note is too high or too low to fit on the stave."
  },
  {
   "id": "ledger",
   "who": "barnaby",
   "text": "We give it a tiny extra line to stand on. A ledger line."
  },
  {
   "id": "again",
   "who": "melody",
   "text": "Let's say them one more time:",
   "prev": "Sometimes a note is too high or too low to fit on the stave. We give it a tiny extra line to stand on. A ledger line."
  },
  {
   "id": "r1",
   "who": "melody",
   "text": "Stave.",
   "prev": "Let's say them one more time:"
  },
  {
   "id": "r2",
   "who": "barnaby",
   "text": "Cleff.",
   "prev": "Stave.",
   "show": "Clef."
  },
  {
   "id": "r3",
   "who": "melody",
   "text": "Note.",
   "prev": "Clef."
  },
  {
   "id": "r4",
   "who": "barnaby",
   "text": "Line and space.",
   "prev": "Note."
  },
  {
   "id": "r5",
   "who": "melody",
   "text": "Ledger line.",
   "prev": "Line and space."
  },
  {
   "id": "well",
   "who": "barnaby",
   "text": "Brilliant!"
  },
  {
   "id": "game2",
   "who": "barnaby",
   "text": "Open Name That Part, and show what you've learned!"
  }
